# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Fey Adept Shadowmark Dice (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DICE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DICE|floor((SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL+1)/2)	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DICE d6 shadowmark damage when its conditions are met; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Fey Adept Truesight Uses (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_TRUESIGHT_USES|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_TRUESIGHT_USES|floor(SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL/4)	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_TRUESIGHT_USES uses per day of truesight from level 4; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
